sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Book lessons and training sessions
    %% Stories: 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 21, 22
    %% Description: A customer views available lessons and books one, books or cancels lessons and training sessions by calling the gym, and views future and past bookings.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant SC as Schedule
    participant LE as Lesson
    participant CU as Customer
    participant BK as Booking
    participant TS as TrainingSession

    %% covers 15
    CP->>SC: view available lessons
    SC->>LE: lessons
    CP->>CU: book a lesson
    CU->>BK: booking
    BK->>LE: booked lesson
    %% covers 18, 19, 21, 22
    CP->>CU: book or cancel a lesson or training session by phone
    CU->>BK: booking
    BK->>TS: booked training session
    %% covers 16, 17
    CP->>CU: view future and past bookings
